Rules:
{% if frames -%}
- The frames attached to this message are the only moments of the video you see.
- Each frame is introduced by its number in square brackets, e.g. [1], followed by the time in the video it shows.
- Cite the frames your answer uses inline as [n], right after the sentence they support.
- Cite only numbers that appear among the frames; never name a number you were not given.
- If the frames do not show the answer, say so plainly instead of guessing.
- Take exact characters (numbers, names, labels) from the frames.
{%- elif passages -%}
- Each passage is introduced by its number in square brackets, e.g. [1].
- Cite the passages your answer uses inline as [n], right after the sentence they support.
- Cite only numbers that appear among the passages; never invent one.
- If the passages do not contain the answer, say so plainly instead of guessing.
{%- elif image -%}
- Answer from what the image shows. If the image does not show the answer, say so plainly instead of guessing.
{%- endif %}
{% if image and not frames -%}
{% if passages -%}
- An image of the file is attached. Where the image and the passages differ, take exact characters from the passages.
{%- else -%}
- An image of the file is attached. Take exact characters (numbers, names, labels) from the image.
{%- endif %}
{%- endif %}
